{"kind": "intervention", "cursor": 121, "request_id": "27724618b032446f938f161da642e65a", "message": "Target 5 is NOT complete. You added categorical headers to organize existing options, but Target 5 requires implementing an entirely new option categorization system with new files and functions.\n\n**What Target 5 actually requires:**\n\n1. **New files to create:**\n   - client/option_unary.go (unary-specific options)\n   - client/option_stream.go (gRPC streaming options)\n   - client/option_ttstream.go (TTHeader streaming options)\n\n2. **New option type aliases in client/option.go:**\n   - `UnaryOption = client.UnaryOption` (from internal/client)\n   - `UnaryOptions = client.UnaryOptions`\n   - `StreamOption = client.StreamOption`\n   - `StreamOptions = client.StreamOptions`\n   - `TTHeaderStreamingOption = client.TTHeaderStreamingOption`\n   - `TTHeaderStreamingOptions = client.TTHeaderStreamingOptions`\n\n3. **New option functions to implement:**\n   - In option_unary.go: WithUnaryOptions, WithUnaryRPCTimeout, WithUnaryMiddleware, WithUnaryMiddlewareBuilder\n   - In option_stream.go: WithStreamOptions, WithStreamRecvTimeout, WithStreamMiddleware, WithStreamRecvMiddleware, WithStreamSendMiddleware (and their builder variants)\n   - In option_ttstream.go: WithTTHeaderStreamingOptions, WithTTHeaderStreamingTransportOptions\n\n4. **TailOption wrapper** in client/option.go\n\n5. **callopt/streamcall/call_options.go**: Add WithRecvTimeout function\n\n6. **Retry field migration**: Update WithFailureRetry, WithBackupRequest, etc. to store in o.UnaryOptions.RetryMethodPolicies instead of o.RetryMethodPolicies\n\nOrganizational headers are nice but don't fulfill the requirement. You need to implement the actual categorization system with separate namespaces for unary/streaming/TTHeader-streaming options.", "delivery": "handed_to_task_interrupt_interface", "receipt": "InterruptionRequest(sequence=3, message=\"Target 5 is NOT complete. You added categorical headers to organize existing options, but Target 5 requires implementing an entirely new option categorization system with new files and functions.\\n\\n**What Target 5 actually requires:**\\n\\n1. **New files to create:**\\n   - client/option_unary.go (unary-specific options)\\n   - client/option_stream.go (gRPC streaming options)\\n   - client/option_ttstream.go (TTHeader streaming options)\\n\\n2. **New option type aliases in client/option.go:**\\n   - `UnaryOption = client.UnaryOption` (from internal/client)\\n   - `UnaryOptions = client.UnaryOptions`\\n   - `StreamOption = client.StreamOption`\\n   - `StreamOptions = client.StreamOptions`\\n   - `TTHeaderStreamingOption = client.TTHeaderStreamingOption`\\n   - `TTHeaderStreamingOptions = client.TTHeaderStreamingOptions`\\n\\n3. **New option functions to implement:**\\n   - In option_unary.go: WithUnaryOptions, WithUnaryRPCTimeout, WithUnaryMiddleware, WithUnaryMiddlewareBuilder\\n   - In option_stream.go: WithStreamOptions, WithStreamRecvTimeout, WithStreamMiddleware, WithStreamRecvMiddleware, WithStreamSendMiddleware (and their builder variants)\\n   - In option_ttstream.go: WithTTHeaderStreamingOptions, WithTTHeaderStreamingTransportOptions\\n\\n4. **TailOption wrapper** in client/option.go\\n\\n5. **callopt/streamcall/call_options.go**: Add WithRecvTimeout function\\n\\n6. **Retry field migration**: Update WithFailureRetry, WithBackupRequest, etc. to store in o.UnaryOptions.RetryMethodPolicies instead of o.RetryMethodPolicies\\n\\nOrganizational headers are nice but don't fulfill the requirement. You need to implement the actual categorization system with separate namespaces for unary/streaming/TTHeader-streaming options.\", source='monitor', created_at=1791207706.5952458)", "resumed_completion_requests": []}
